# Credence band/decimal CONSISTENCY fixture. Three claims whose numeric
# gmeow:claimCredence / gmeow:standpointCredence each fall inside the canonical
# threshold range of their asserted qualitative band:
#   credenceLikely   [0.5, 0.9)  ← 0.7
#   credenceCertain  [0.9, 1.0]  ← 0.95
#   credencePossible [0.0, 0.5)  ← 0.2
# run_shacl MUST report NO violation — the decimal and band agree, and the
# decimal is a valid in-range advisory refinement of the band.

@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/shapes/> .
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .

ex:likely-claim
    gmeow:claimCredenceLevel gmeow:credenceLikely ;
    gmeow:claimCredence 0.7 .

ex:certain-claim
    gmeow:claimCredenceLevel gmeow:credenceCertain ;
    gmeow:claimCredence 0.95 .

ex:possible-standpoint
    gmeow:standpointCredenceLevel gmeow:credencePossible ;
    gmeow:standpointCredence 0.2 .
